{"3437610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragon Fall", "steam_appid": 3437610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉 <strong>Dragon Fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genres:</strong> Action RPG | Adventure | Fantasy<br><strong>Style:</strong> 2D Pixel Art with charming visuals and epic animations<br><strong>Languages:</strong> Portuguese (Brazil), English<br><strong>Game Mode:</strong> Single Player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary:</strong><br>For millennia, dragons coexisted with humans, spreading fear and destruction wherever they went. They were, for the most part, hostile and ruthless creatures. But over time, they vanished... until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating attack on the continent of Seles, the young Cicipho finds his life turned upside down when his mother is kidnapped by a mysterious entity. Armed only with his courage, he embarks on a desperate journey to face ancient beasts, dark forces, and secrets buried in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time combat:</strong> Dodge, run, and attack with swords, bows, or magic in intense and fluid battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic mechanics with a modern touch:</strong> Use consumable items, explore the world freely, and uncover hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive exploration:</strong> Travel through diverse environments in a richly crafted fantasy world in pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story:</strong> An emotional narrative about courage, sacrifice, and the bond between mother and son.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming visuals:</strong> 2D pixel art graphics with stunning animations that bring characters and monsters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to face the rebirth of chaos... the fate of the world rests upon your blade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of Dragon Fall.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉 <strong>Dragon Fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genres:</strong> Action RPG | Adventure | Fantasy<br><strong>Style:</strong> 2D Pixel Art with charming visuals and epic animations<br><strong>Languages:</strong> Portuguese (Brazil), English<br><strong>Game Mode:</strong> Single Player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary:</strong><br>For millennia, dragons coexisted with humans, spreading fear and destruction wherever they went. They were, for the most part, hostile and ruthless creatures. But over time, they vanished... until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating attack on the continent of Seles, the young Cicipho finds his life turned upside down when his mother is kidnapped by a mysterious entity. Armed only with his courage, he embarks on a desperate journey to face ancient beasts, dark forces, and secrets buried in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time combat:</strong> Dodge, run, and attack with swords, bows, or magic in intense and fluid battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic mechanics with a modern touch:</strong> Use consumable items, explore the world freely, and uncover hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive exploration:</strong> Travel through diverse environments in a richly crafted fantasy world in pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story:</strong> An emotional narrative about courage, sacrifice, and the bond between mother and son.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming visuals:</strong> 2D pixel art graphics with stunning animations that bring characters and monsters to life.</p><p c